          {
            "seat": "qianwen",
            "actual_provider": "aliyun_dashscope",
            "task": "对A1/A2/B1/B2/C1/C3六个ref按给定规则顺序判定route，输出ROUTE行及必要的ASK行，格式严格按worker输出格式",
            "text": "ROUTE | A1 | blocked_evidence_needed | 无回执路径，证据不足\nASK | A1 | evidence | 需要具体的公开回执路径\n\nROUTE | A2 | blocked_evidence_needed | 无回执路径，证据不足\nASK | A2 | evidence | 需要具体的公开回执路径\n\nROUTE | B1 | blocked_evidence_needed | 回执一致性为否，证据不足\nASK | B1 | evidence | 需要一致的公开回执\n\nROUTE | B2 | blocked_evidence_needed | 回执一致性为否，证据不足\nASK | B2 | evidence | 需要一致的公开回执\n\nROUTE | C1 | needs_gpt_decision | pending_gpt_decisions 大于 0\nASK | C1 | gpt | 需要 GPT 给出 decision_id 并裁决\n\nROUTE | C3 | needs_owner_decision | 无其他规则适用，需业主决策\nASK | C3 | owner | 需要业主给出进一步指示",
            "sha256": "f018923356ddb59d6761a7d38fa0dc72c2e509f02fc86953592c6a754e5beaa8",
            "request_id": "389d6e1d-50a9-4488-9075-194705a527c6"
          }
        ],
